WEBVTT

00:00:06.610 --> 00:00:08.230
<i>The Teiai Group.</i>

00:00:08.610 --> 00:00:12.950
<i>Their ruler is the monster that 
dominates the underworld,</i>

00:00:12.950 --> 00:00:15.350
<i>Hyoudou Kazutaka!</i>

00:00:15.350 --> 00:00:17.860
<i>Then there's the chief executive officer,</i>

00:00:17.860 --> 00:00:22.330
<i>the man who occupies the number 
two position, Tonegawa Yukio!</i>

00:00:23.060 --> 00:00:27.380
<i>But here we see the man who threatens 
his position as Teiai's number two man,</i>

00:00:27.380 --> 00:00:29.390
<i>one of the company's rising stars,</i>

00:00:29.390 --> 00:00:32.510
<i>the man who could be called 
Tonegawa's nemesis...</i>

00:00:34.280 --> 00:00:37.640
<i>His name is Kurosaki Yoshihiro!</i>

00:00:39.250 --> 00:00:41.890
I'll allow it. Do what you want.

00:00:42.890 --> 00:00:43.890
<i>The manliness!</i>

00:00:44.280 --> 00:00:48.860
Just try to make sure you don't slip up.

00:00:49.350 --> 00:00:52.780
I see. The important thing is that 
you're prepared for what's next.

00:00:52.780 --> 00:00:54.780
Win this, Ichijou.

00:00:55.130 --> 00:00:57.780
<i>His kindness toward his men,
his fierce motivational methods...</i>

00:00:57.780 --> 00:00:59.780
<i>He wields both the carrot and the whip!</i>

00:01:00.730 --> 00:01:02.410
<i>Kurosaki Yoshihiro.</i>

00:01:02.410 --> 00:01:07.320
<i>It will be some time before we witness 
what it is that distinguishes him.</i>

00:01:11.370 --> 00:01:13.300
This should be good.

00:01:13.860 --> 00:01:18.100
The restaurant that's opening this 
week at the top of the Teiai Hotel

00:01:15.380 --> 00:01:18.930
<i>Agenda 15
\h\h\h\h</i><b>Natural Enemies</b>

00:01:18.100 --> 00:01:22.560
is a first-class gourmet establishment 
planned with my personal touch...

00:01:22.560 --> 00:01:24.730
And tonight we test the menu.

00:01:24.730 --> 00:01:28.940
Just the thought of it 
gets the drool going...

00:01:29.450 --> 00:01:30.230
Don't you agree?

00:01:30.230 --> 00:01:33.320
Yes, sir. We can't stop drooling, either.

00:01:35.410 --> 00:01:38.570
President, the situation is drool-worthy,

00:01:38.570 --> 00:01:41.950
but I think you're drooling a bit <i>too</i> much.

00:01:44.950 --> 00:01:46.460
<b>Psst... Psst...</b>

00:01:47.960 --> 00:01:49.960
<b>Psst...</b>

00:01:51.570 --> 00:01:54.210
I appreciate it, Kurosaki. 
That's very considerate.

00:01:56.820 --> 00:01:59.400
I nearly embarrassed myself.

00:01:59.400 --> 00:02:00.220
Not at all, sir.

00:02:00.770 --> 00:02:02.400
<i>There he goes again...</i>

00:02:02.400 --> 00:02:04.630
<i>He's always like this.</i>

00:02:04.630 --> 00:02:07.640
<i>He says the things that I can never 
bring myself to say to the president,</i>

00:02:07.640 --> 00:02:09.700
<i>and always gets points for it.</i>

00:02:09.700 --> 00:02:11.980
<i>If I tried the same thing...</i>

00:02:12.570 --> 00:02:15.230
President, you're drooling too much.

00:02:16.500 --> 00:02:19.240
Are you mocking me?! Take your punishment!

00:02:19.810 --> 00:02:21.740
<i>It'd definitely turn out like that.</i>

00:02:21.740 --> 00:02:23.770
Right, let's get going.

00:02:23.770 --> 00:02:24.420
Yes, sir.

00:02:25.740 --> 00:02:28.410
<i>Damn it, I can't stand this.</i>

00:02:28.020 --> 00:02:31.410
<i>Vex... Vex...</i>

00:02:28.410 --> 00:02:31.410
<i>Tonegawa's vexation begins to mount.</i>

00:02:32.900 --> 00:02:34.680
<i>Tonegawa Yukio,</i>

00:02:34.680 --> 00:02:38.010
<i>the number two man of 
the massive Teiai Group.</i>

00:02:39.300 --> 00:02:41.680
<i>He serves the monster 
of the financial sector.</i>

00:02:41.680 --> 00:02:46.020
<i>This shot-caller rose to the position 
of President Hyoudou's right-hand man.</i>

00:02:47.520 --> 00:02:50.810
<i>This is the story of the battles 
he waged as a middle manager,</i>

00:02:50.810 --> 00:02:55.660
<i>in the shadows of the glory 
and fame he achieved...</i>

00:02:55.660 --> 00:03:02.610
<i>The small, unremarkable story... about 
the struggles of a remarkable man.</i>

00:03:06.620 --> 00:03:13.170
<b>Middle Management Blues</b>

00:03:06.620 --> 00:03:13.170
<b><i>Mr. Tonegawa</i></b>

00:04:32.680 --> 00:04:34.550
And here we are.

00:04:34.550 --> 00:04:40.520
Your first dish is a swallow's nest soup 
made using the highest quality ingredients.

00:04:40.520 --> 00:04:42.070
Please enjoy.

00:04:48.790 --> 00:04:50.740
<i>This is really salty...</i>

00:04:51.400 --> 00:04:55.520
<i>No, it's more than just 
salty! Is bitingly salty!</i>

00:05:03.490 --> 00:05:07.110
<i>It's like I'm drinking seawater!</i>

00:05:07.990 --> 00:05:10.820
What do you think, Hyoudou-sama?

00:05:11.860 --> 00:05:16.630
It goes down smoothly. I like the 
combined sweetness and umami.

00:05:17.250 --> 00:05:19.240
Thank you, sir.

00:05:19.240 --> 00:05:20.880
Don't you think so, Tonegawa?

00:05:22.850 --> 00:05:26.510
Y-Yes. It's very sweet, and easy to to eat.

00:05:26.510 --> 00:05:28.640
No, it's way too salty.

00:05:29.700 --> 00:05:31.140
<b>Psst...</b>

00:05:32.370 --> 00:05:33.390
True enough!

00:05:34.420 --> 00:05:37.100
Now that you mention it, it's too salty.

00:05:37.100 --> 00:05:39.540
Unthinkably so.

00:05:40.360 --> 00:05:41.990
Good job noticing, Kurosaki.

00:05:41.990 --> 00:05:42.950
Not at all, sir.

00:05:42.950 --> 00:05:45.590
You hear that, maitre d'?!

00:05:45.590 --> 00:05:47.110
I-I'm sorry, sir.

00:05:47.490 --> 00:05:51.190
But since you seem to like it, Tonegawa-san,

00:05:51.190 --> 00:05:53.870
feel free to help yourself to mine.

00:05:55.160 --> 00:05:56.730
Mine, too.

00:05:59.800 --> 00:06:02.730
<i>But I'm trying to cut back on salt!</i>

00:06:04.200 --> 00:06:07.420
<i>Tonegawa's blood pressure 
surpasses its limit!</i>

00:06:07.870 --> 00:06:12.810
<i>Damn it, why?! Why is he 
able to rush ahead so easily?!</i>

00:06:14.330 --> 00:06:17.050
<i>Kurosaki sprints onward, 
with no fear for the field</i>

00:06:17.050 --> 00:06:19.560
<i>of landmines that interacting 
with Hyoudou involves!</i>

00:06:20.310 --> 00:06:22.560
<i>He seizes control of the pace from Tonegawa!</i>

00:06:25.690 --> 00:06:28.820
<i>How does he never step on any mines?!</i>

00:06:29.940 --> 00:06:32.930
<i>Wait... Does that mean...</i>

00:06:33.240 --> 00:06:34.580
<b>Psst...</b>

00:06:34.830 --> 00:06:36.580
<b>Psst...</b>

00:06:45.090 --> 00:06:46.950
What is it, Kurosaki?

00:06:46.950 --> 00:06:48.380
It's this steak, sir.

00:06:48.770 --> 00:06:51.220
It's too tough. I can't even chew it.

00:06:51.640 --> 00:06:53.260
<b>Psst...</b>

00:06:53.610 --> 00:06:55.490
<i>There it is! This is my chance!</i>

00:06:55.490 --> 00:06:57.270
<i>He reaches for an opportunity!</i>

00:06:57.690 --> 00:06:59.770
I-I agree.

00:06:59.770 --> 00:07:01.560
I was thinking that it's too tough.

00:07:03.730 --> 00:07:07.440
True enough. The steak is a bit too tough.

00:07:07.800 --> 00:07:09.530
Just like you two said.

00:07:09.530 --> 00:07:10.320
<i>Yes!</i>

00:07:13.820 --> 00:07:17.830
<i>I've managed to position myself 
safely behind Kurosaki!</i>

00:07:17.830 --> 00:07:20.140
<i>Tonegawa has a bright idea!</i>

00:07:20.140 --> 00:07:22.830
<i>He chooses to stick closely behind Kurosaki!</i>

00:07:23.300 --> 00:07:26.340
<i>And now, I take the next step...</i>

00:07:26.710 --> 00:07:30.470
This is hardly a steak. It's more like rubber!

00:07:30.820 --> 00:07:34.340
<i>I'll completely overtake Kurosaki!</i>

00:07:35.030 --> 00:07:36.610
<i>That should do it...</i>

00:07:38.970 --> 00:07:40.100
Rubber?!

00:07:42.610 --> 00:07:45.110
<i>The angle of his eyebrows hits 40 degrees!</i>

00:07:45.830 --> 00:07:48.230
<i>He's in the red zone!</i>

00:07:48.580 --> 00:07:51.240
Did you just call it rubber?!

00:07:51.240 --> 00:07:54.990
N-No, I didn't say rubber...

00:07:56.020 --> 00:07:58.990
<i>They pass 40 degrees! 
Beyond the danger zone!</i>

00:07:59.410 --> 00:08:01.750
R-Rub... Rub...

00:08:02.240 --> 00:08:06.300
<i>Fifty degrees! They just keep going!</i>

00:08:06.300 --> 00:08:07.770
It rubs me!

00:08:08.310 --> 00:08:09.890
His opinion rubs me the right way.

00:08:10.680 --> 00:08:11.760
I see.

00:08:13.240 --> 00:08:16.260
<i>Normalcy is restored. 
Back into the safety zone.</i>

00:08:17.970 --> 00:08:19.770
<i>That was a close one...</i>

00:08:23.640 --> 00:08:26.770
<i>I nearly stepped on a mine just now!</i>

00:08:29.130 --> 00:08:32.280
<i>It was the brink of death! 
A last-minute save!</i>

00:08:33.510 --> 00:08:34.990
<i>I can't get past him.</i>

00:08:35.400 --> 00:08:38.010
<i>For now, I shouldn't get too ambitious.</i>

00:08:38.010 --> 00:08:40.990
<i>The best thing to is just stay where I am,</i>

00:08:41.430 --> 00:08:43.410
<i>following Kurosaki's lead.</i>

00:08:46.450 --> 00:08:51.410
I have to say, I've found myself 
rather irritable lately.

00:08:51.410 --> 00:08:54.510
Maybe I'm not getting enough calcium.

00:08:54.900 --> 00:09:00.580
What are you saying, sir? A little calcium 
isn't going to help you keep your cool.

00:09:01.190 --> 00:09:03.640
I don't think it'd help, either.

00:09:05.010 --> 00:09:07.110
You've got a point there!

00:09:07.110 --> 00:09:09.150
In fact, I'd say you were born that way.

00:09:09.150 --> 00:09:13.360
Maybe you were just born 
with a short temper, sir?

00:09:13.360 --> 00:09:15.150
I overwhelmingly agree.

00:09:16.630 --> 00:09:22.240
<i>It strikes him. 
A faint, but certain dissonance.</i>

00:09:22.840 --> 00:09:25.190
<i>Should I really keep following this path?</i>

00:09:25.190 --> 00:09:26.500
<i>It feels a bit like...</i>

00:09:28.210 --> 00:09:31.490
<i>we're treading into dangerous territory.</i>

00:09:31.990 --> 00:09:36.510
<i>They were indeed passing through a 
route full of hazards! The danger zone!</i>

00:09:38.010 --> 00:09:40.510
You two don't mince words, do you?

00:09:41.490 --> 00:09:44.020
<i>Well, the president's laughing...</i>

00:09:44.330 --> 00:09:48.290
To be honest, when you're in a 
good mood for three days in a row,

00:09:48.290 --> 00:09:51.400
I start worrying that the 
weather's about to turn.

00:09:55.170 --> 00:09:59.530
N-Normal weather is one thing, 
but I worry that it'll be raining spears!

00:10:01.200 --> 00:10:03.160
<b>Psst...</b>

00:10:04.160 --> 00:10:05.620
<b>Psst...</b>

00:10:05.970 --> 00:10:07.960
T-Tonegawa-san...

00:10:07.910 --> 00:10:09.080
<b>Psst... Psst...</b>

00:10:09.640 --> 00:10:12.000
That's going a little too far.

00:10:12.980 --> 00:10:15.300
Spears are... out?

00:10:15.300 --> 00:10:17.760
Tonegawa, you bastard...

00:10:18.140 --> 00:10:22.510
Are you mocking me?! Is that it?

00:10:22.510 --> 00:10:26.520
<i>Tonegawa faces an overwhelming emergency!</i>

00:10:28.570 --> 00:10:31.770
<i>The bastard... He turned a corner!</i>

00:10:31.770 --> 00:10:37.530
<i>Kurosaki breaks with a sharp curve, 
dodging the danger zone!</i>

00:10:37.800 --> 00:10:40.250
Th-That's not it, sir! I meant...

00:10:40.250 --> 00:10:41.410
Silence!

00:10:41.410 --> 00:10:43.910
<i>And in the end...</i>

00:10:45.730 --> 00:10:49.540
<i>Tonegawa lands directly 
on a Hyoudou Claymore!</i>

00:10:50.040 --> 00:10:52.010
Take your punishment! Punishment!

00:10:52.010 --> 00:10:53.560
Punishment! Punishment!

00:10:53.560 --> 00:10:57.010
<i>I can't tell where the border is!</i>

00:10:53.560 --> 00:10:58.050
Punishment!

00:11:05.830 --> 00:11:07.310
I see.

00:11:07.770 --> 00:11:10.040
This is the horse, then?

00:11:10.040 --> 00:11:11.100
Yes, sir.

00:11:11.100 --> 00:11:14.060
The offspring of Blue Fable 
and Monday Silence,

00:11:14.060 --> 00:11:16.410
a full-fledged thoroughbred.

00:11:16.410 --> 00:11:20.070
I'm sure he'll take you 
to the top, Hyoudou-sama.

00:11:21.560 --> 00:11:23.370
What do you think, Tonegawa?

00:11:23.370 --> 00:11:26.070
Well, the high-quality 
breeding is a good sign,

00:11:26.070 --> 00:11:28.200
plus his build and hair look remarkable.

00:11:28.690 --> 00:11:32.210
I think this is the perfect 
racing horse for you, sir.

00:11:33.270 --> 00:11:35.680
You think so as well, eh?

00:11:35.680 --> 00:11:37.040
Very good, I'll take him.

00:11:37.040 --> 00:11:38.840
Thank you, sir!

00:11:40.470 --> 00:11:45.550
Indeed, he has a beautiful 
white mane, much like myself.

00:11:46.200 --> 00:11:48.310
All right, your name will be...

00:11:48.720 --> 00:11:50.810
<b>Psst...</b>

00:11:51.990 --> 00:11:53.810
Kazutakaiser!

00:11:56.810 --> 00:12:00.070
<i>The horse is christened Kazutakaiser!</i>

00:11:57.840 --> 00:12:00.070
<b>Kazutakaiser</b>

00:12:00.070 --> 00:12:02.320
That's wonderful!

00:12:01.130 --> 00:12:02.320
That's wonderful!

00:12:05.460 --> 00:12:08.830
What's with that shabby-looking horse?

00:12:09.160 --> 00:12:11.830
Okay, Tonegawa, you'll buy one, too.

00:12:12.280 --> 00:12:14.580
This is the perfect horse for you.

00:12:14.900 --> 00:12:18.090
Er, wait, sir... I can't just...

00:12:18.520 --> 00:12:21.090
Let's see... For his name...

00:12:21.550 --> 00:12:23.090
<b>Psst...</b>

00:12:24.550 --> 00:12:26.600
I say he's Yukioh!

00:12:30.690 --> 00:12:32.850
<i>The horse is christened Yukioh!</i>

00:12:31.620 --> 00:12:32.850
<b>Yukioh</b>

00:12:32.850 --> 00:12:36.610
<i>Yukioh! Yukioh!</i>

00:12:36.610 --> 00:12:37.900
Wonderful!

00:12:37.900 --> 00:12:39.250
Yes, wonderful!

00:12:40.690 --> 00:12:43.530
<i>And so Tonegawa becomes the owner 
of the pitiful-looking racehorse,</i>

00:12:43.530 --> 00:12:45.610
<i>Yukioh, by sheer momentum.</i>

00:12:45.610 --> 00:12:48.870
<i>Why did this happen?!</i>

00:12:49.650 --> 00:12:50.870
<i>Two years later...</i>

00:12:50.870 --> 00:12:54.370
<b>An overwhelming string
of victories...!!</b>

00:12:50.870 --> 00:12:54.370
<b>Another poor showing
for Kazutakaiser...</b>

00:12:50.870 --> 00:12:54.370
<b>Y
u
k
i
o
h</b>

00:12:50.870 --> 00:12:54.370
<b>The streak
continues!</b>

00:12:51.940 --> 00:12:54.370
<i>Yukioh's been on a hot streak.</i>

00:12:54.370 --> 00:12:57.760
<i>Which I'd normally be glad about...</i>

00:12:57.760 --> 00:12:59.880
<i>But these headlines are bad news!</i>

00:13:00.220 --> 00:13:02.310
<i>Kazutakaiser's been in bad shape,</i>

00:13:02.310 --> 00:13:08.390
<i>so I've tried to avoid talking with 
the president about horse racing...</i>

00:13:13.590 --> 00:13:15.390
H-Hello?

00:13:15.390 --> 00:13:17.050
<i>It's me.</i>

00:13:17.050 --> 00:13:19.830
Sir! I-Is something the matter?

00:13:19.830 --> 00:13:23.400
<i>Never you mind! Meet me in the parking lot!</i>

00:13:23.400 --> 00:13:26.400
Kaneshiro Training Center

00:13:27.570 --> 00:13:31.790
Kazutakaiser has plenty of 
potential, surely enough,

00:13:32.330 --> 00:13:34.850
but his times just aren't improving.

00:13:35.660 --> 00:13:37.880
In contrast...

00:13:38.360 --> 00:13:40.670
Yukioh's been doing very well.

00:13:41.620 --> 00:13:44.610
He might just manage to win the Yasuoka Cup.

00:13:44.610 --> 00:13:45.960
<i>Stop that!</i>

00:13:45.960 --> 00:13:48.680
<i>If you say that in front of the president...</i>

00:13:50.920 --> 00:13:52.390
I see, I see!

00:13:53.640 --> 00:13:57.700
So he's not doing well. That's such a shame.

00:13:57.700 --> 00:14:02.900
But what's done is done. 
He'll just have to make up for it.

00:14:02.900 --> 00:14:05.400
Isn't that right, Kazutakaiser?

00:14:06.440 --> 00:14:07.900
<b>Psst...</b>

00:14:09.370 --> 00:14:11.520
President, that's Yukioh—

00:14:11.520 --> 00:14:13.160
Right, Tonegawa?

00:14:13.160 --> 00:14:15.660
Wouldn't you agree

00:14:16.310 --> 00:14:20.170
that Kazutakaiser here has a bright future?

00:14:21.810 --> 00:14:26.290
<i>It goes without saying, 
but this horse is not Kazutakaiser.</i>

00:14:26.290 --> 00:14:27.550
<i>It's Yukioh.</i>

00:14:27.550 --> 00:14:36.060
<i>Yukioh</i>

00:14:27.550 --> 00:14:36.060
<i>Kazutakaiser</i>

00:14:28.070 --> 00:14:31.570
<i>What the president is trying 
to do, without a doubt,</i>

00:14:31.570 --> 00:14:35.510
<i>is swap his employee's 
skilled horse with his own.</i>

00:14:36.350 --> 00:14:43.820
<b>Psst...</b>

00:14:37.940 --> 00:14:41.650
<i>For any normal person, it'd be 
an outrageous act of tyranny.</i>

00:14:41.650 --> 00:14:43.820
<i>One that would be denied, 
soundly, without a doubt.</i>

00:14:43.820 --> 00:14:46.690
The Teiai <b>Quiz Show</b>

00:14:44.320 --> 00:14:48.880
<i>However, throughout his career, 
Tonegawa has given one type of answer.</i>

00:14:48.880 --> 00:14:53.450
<i>The kind of answer that assures 
the president and feeds his ego.</i>

00:14:51.200 --> 00:14:53.450
<b>Question 1:
Would you eat a
100x super spicy curry?</b>

00:14:53.450 --> 00:14:57.200
<b>Yes!
Gladly!</b>

00:14:54.070 --> 00:14:57.200
<i>And he does it with a smile: "Yes, sir!"</i>

00:14:58.050 --> 00:15:01.710
<i>That is how he climbed to 
the position of number two!</i>

00:15:02.230 --> 00:15:07.020
<i>You could even say this is 
how he survived in Teiai!</i>

00:15:07.020 --> 00:15:08.720
<i>The secret of his success!</i>

00:15:09.110 --> 00:15:13.220
<i>As those around him have failed, 
he has withstood the president's egomania.</i>

00:15:13.690 --> 00:15:16.660
<i>That is how he got to where he is!</i>

00:15:17.220 --> 00:15:20.110
<i>Thus, he only has one choice!</i>

00:15:20.110 --> 00:15:22.230
<i>Tonegawa's answer will naturally be...</i>

00:15:24.440 --> 00:15:26.730
Yes, sir. He does.

00:15:27.070 --> 00:15:29.990
Kazutakaiser here has a bright future.

00:15:32.420 --> 00:15:33.990
<i>They are swapped.</i>

00:15:33.990 --> 00:15:37.260
<b>Yukioh</b>

00:15:33.990 --> 00:15:37.640
<i>If the president calls Yukioh "Kazutakaiser"...</i>

00:15:37.260 --> 00:15:39.370
<b>Kazutakaiser</b>

00:15:39.370 --> 00:15:42.270
<b>Kazutakaiser</b>

00:15:39.800 --> 00:15:44.630
<i>Kazutakaiser naturally becomes Yukioh!</i>

00:15:42.270 --> 00:15:44.630
<b>Yukioh</b>

00:15:44.630 --> 00:15:47.650
<b>Kazutakaiser</b>

00:15:44.630 --> 00:15:47.650
<b>Yukioh</b>

00:15:45.350 --> 00:15:48.520
<i>Kazutakaiser and Yukioh swap identities!</i>

00:15:47.650 --> 00:15:49.130
<b>Yukioh</b>

00:15:47.650 --> 00:15:49.130
<b>Kazutakaiser</b>

00:15:50.410 --> 00:15:52.930
<i>Then, several weeks later...</i>

00:15:55.080 --> 00:15:59.190
<i>It's a shocking collision between 
both horses at the Yasuoka Cup!</i>

00:16:00.020 --> 00:16:05.460
<i>We're here at the paddock for the 11th 
race today, the 45th Yasuoka Cup.</i>

00:16:06.020 --> 00:16:10.030
<i>#1 is Kazutakaiser. He's gained 32 kilograms.</i>

00:16:10.030 --> 00:16:11.780
<i>That's quite a gain.</i>

00:16:12.160 --> 00:16:17.030
<i>He's like a different horse. It almost 
seems like his color has changed, as well.</i>

00:16:17.030 --> 00:16:21.240
<i>#2 is Yukioh. He's lost 32 kilograms.</i>

00:16:21.240 --> 00:16:22.910
<i>Maybe they've pushed him a bit too hard.</i>

00:16:23.350 --> 00:16:26.670
<i>His mane has even turned white. 
I hope he's doing all right.</i>

00:16:33.170 --> 00:16:36.180
Is this amazing or what?

00:16:36.180 --> 00:16:37.780
You don't even need sunglasses.

00:16:37.780 --> 00:16:40.500
Th-Thank you, sir.

00:16:40.500 --> 00:16:43.180
Come on, you're next.

00:16:47.190 --> 00:16:49.460
Hold still, now!

00:16:49.910 --> 00:16:54.320
<i>The kind of power the president 
wields always amazes me.</i>

00:16:54.320 --> 00:16:57.960
<i>He was actually able to push 
the swap of the horses through.</i>

00:17:00.850 --> 00:17:01.960
Huh?

00:17:02.490 --> 00:17:05.790
Aren't Yukioh and Kazutakaiser reversed?

00:17:06.850 --> 00:17:09.020
K-Kurosaki!

00:17:09.020 --> 00:17:11.550
<i>A shock courses through Tonegawa!</i>

00:17:12.010 --> 00:17:13.780
Idiot! Shh!

00:17:13.780 --> 00:17:17.160
I mean, Kazutakaiser got 
his name for a reason.

00:17:17.160 --> 00:17:18.990
His mane is just like the president's hair.

00:17:18.990 --> 00:17:20.580
It doesn't matter! Stop!

00:17:21.190 --> 00:17:23.570
I guess you can't tell the difference...

00:17:23.570 --> 00:17:24.360
President!

00:17:24.360 --> 00:17:25.590
Idiot!

00:17:26.250 --> 00:17:28.440
Look at the #1 horse.

00:17:28.760 --> 00:17:31.690
That's Yukioh, not Kazutakaiser, isn't it?

00:17:33.490 --> 00:17:34.690
<b>Psst...</b>

00:17:43.970 --> 00:17:47.210
Your sense of humor never 
fails to amuse, Kurosaki.

00:17:48.980 --> 00:17:53.150
That's clearly Yu— Kazutakaiser!

00:17:53.150 --> 00:17:56.720
Sir, is it just me, or were 
you about to say Yukioh?

00:17:58.150 --> 00:17:59.910
Of course not!

00:17:59.910 --> 00:18:02.380
<i>D-Damn it!</i>

00:18:02.380 --> 00:18:07.480
<i>Why is he the only one who can 
say "no" to the president's demands</i>

00:18:05.410 --> 00:18:07.480
No, thanks.

00:18:07.480 --> 00:18:11.480
<i>and come out completely unscathed?!</i>

00:18:08.370 --> 00:18:11.480
No, thanks.

00:18:11.480 --> 00:18:13.610
You are correct!

00:18:12.090 --> 00:18:15.160
<i>And he somehow gains favor by doing it!</i>

00:18:19.460 --> 00:18:21.380
President, you're drooling again.

00:18:21.380 --> 00:18:23.870
Oh, my apologies.

00:18:24.200 --> 00:18:25.680
<i>I can't stand it!</i>

00:18:24.200 --> 00:18:28.870
<i>Vex... Vex... Vex...</i>

00:18:25.680 --> 00:18:28.870
<i>Tonegawa is overwhelmingly vexed.</i>

00:18:32.650 --> 00:18:35.510
<i>All horses are now in their lanes.</i>

00:18:37.110 --> 00:18:38.590
<i>And they're off!</i>

00:18:38.590 --> 00:18:39.630
<i>Oh, look at that!</i>

00:18:41.000 --> 00:18:43.880
<i>#1, Kazutakaiser, is off to a rough start!</i>

00:18:43.880 --> 00:18:45.390
<i>He's well behind the pack!</i>

00:18:46.890 --> 00:18:48.830
<i>In the lead is Yukioh,</i>

00:18:48.830 --> 00:18:52.900
<i>followed by #7, Earnest Age, 
and #11, Mikoko's Power.</i>

00:18:54.250 --> 00:18:58.400
Go! Move it, Kazutakaiser!

00:18:58.400 --> 00:19:04.230
<i>Please, current Kazutakaiser, 
former Yukioh! Get moving!</i>

00:19:07.220 --> 00:19:11.670
<i>With 300 meters left, 
the race is about to take a turn!</i>

00:19:12.100 --> 00:19:13.970
<i>Here comes Kazutakaiser!</i>

00:19:13.970 --> 00:19:16.670
<i>Despite his rough start, 
he's rapidly gaining ground!</i>

00:19:17.020 --> 00:19:19.170
<i>And now he's approaching the lead!</i>

00:19:21.010 --> 00:19:22.890
<i>Will it be Kazutakaiser or Yukioh?</i>

00:19:22.890 --> 00:19:24.930
<i>Yukioh or Kazutakaiser?!</i>

00:19:26.770 --> 00:19:31.360
Go! Leave him behind, Yuki— Kazutakaiser!

00:19:31.360 --> 00:19:33.940
<i>Go! You have to do this, Kazutakaiser!</i>

00:19:34.400 --> 00:19:35.690
<i>The former Yukioh!</i>

00:19:35.690 --> 00:19:38.280
<i>Will Tonegawa's hopes reach him?</i>

00:19:38.280 --> 00:19:43.200
<i>Will his wishes for the current Kazutakaiser, 
the former Yukioh, come true?!</i>

00:19:43.200 --> 00:19:45.700
Go, Kazutakaiser!

00:19:45.700 --> 00:19:48.700
<i>Please, you have to win, former Yukioh!</i>

00:19:48.700 --> 00:19:51.380
<i>Tonegawa prays with his whole heart!</i>

00:19:51.380 --> 00:19:56.090
<i>You can do this, current 
Kazutakaiser and former Yukioh!</i>

00:19:56.090 --> 00:20:00.590
Kazutakaiser! Kazutakaiser! Kazutakaiser!

00:20:00.590 --> 00:20:05.090
<i>Former Yukioh! Former Yukioh! 
Former Yukioh!</i>

00:20:05.090 --> 00:20:07.600
Kazutakaiser! Kazutakaiser!

00:20:07.600 --> 00:20:10.100
<i>Former Yukioh! Former Yukioh!</i>

00:20:11.580 --> 00:20:12.350
<i>The chase is on!</i>

00:20:12.910 --> 00:20:14.610
<i>Another horse is coming up from the rear!</i>

00:20:14.610 --> 00:20:17.980
<i>It's #8, Darkurosaki!</i>

00:20:19.830 --> 00:20:22.240
Oh, that's my horse.

00:20:29.990 --> 00:20:35.250
<i>He's done it! #8, Darkurosaki, 
is the first across the finish line!</i>

00:20:35.570 --> 00:20:37.650
Hey, he did it.

00:20:39.880 --> 00:20:41.880
<i>An unexpected ambush...</i>

00:20:41.880 --> 00:20:44.630
<i>from Kurosaki's horse, Darkurosaki!</i>

00:20:45.410 --> 00:20:48.470
<i>Tonegawa and Hyoudou are both speechless!</i>

00:20:50.230 --> 00:20:54.370
<i>This is the story of a lone man who 
struggles between his employer,</i>

00:20:54.790 --> 00:20:57.520
<i>the president, his own 
employees, the men in black,</i>

00:20:57.520 --> 00:21:00.780
<i>and, occasionally, the other executives 
who threaten his position</i>

00:21:01.220 --> 00:21:03.510
<i>as the number two man in the company.</i>

00:21:04.340 --> 00:21:08.780
<i>Tonegawa Yukio: Middle Manager!</i>

00:21:08.780 --> 00:21:11.200
Kaneshiro Training Center

00:21:09.720 --> 00:21:11.200
<i>The next day...</i>

00:21:12.970 --> 00:21:15.960
I'm counting on you, Kazutakaiser!

00:21:15.960 --> 00:21:19.090
Sir, that's Darkurosaki.

00:22:54.600 --> 00:22:56.820
<i>Next time, "Unofficial Announcement."</i>

00:22:55.680 --> 00:23:00.250
<b>Unofficial Announcement</b>
